    "addendum_content_raw": "\n An Annulment of my marriage to   was granted by the Second Judicial District Court in and for the County of Washoe, Nevada on October 18, 2019\n in Case No.  .  Pursuant to NRS 125.290(2), the marriage was \"declared null and void from its inception as if Carla and   had never participated\n in any such marriage ceremony.\"  At that time, my name was restored to Carla Levonne Baldwin.  A copy of the order may be provided upon request.  All\n investments listed in Section VII in my initial financial disclosure were and are the sole and separate property of  .  Capital One Bank Credit Card and\n Citibank Credit Card listed in Section VI in the initial report are now under the reporting requirement threshold.",
